//! `ember`: Mercury orange on white by day, orange on true OLED black by night: the brand's own sun colour.
//!
//! Generated by `examples/palette_gen.rs` from a few design tokens; the tables below are plain
//! literals. Accent fill: light `#c64c21`, dark `#ff8a2f`.

